{"id":"n26962-4-9","stage":1,"title":"뽑다 · 选拔","scene":"学校与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26962-4-9-1","ko":"유민아, 너 반장 되었다면서?","zh":"裕敏啊，你当上班长了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민아,","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"반장","meaning":"班长","explanation":"반장：班长。","readings":[{"term":"반장","audio":"/audio/42215d859bc4bc8e6a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57186","senseId":"3","lemma":"반장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반장","audio":"/audio/42215d859bc4bc8e6a78.mp3"}},{"text":"되었다면서?","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되었다면서","audio":"/audio/530ccd1f8a6e477009c7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"42215d859bc4bc8e","term":"반장","zh":"班长","audio":"/audio/42215d859bc4bc8e6a78.mp3","entryId":"57186","definition":"学校里代表班级的人。","pronunciation":["반장"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f43612bf5e9a37eef718.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26962-4-9-2","ko":"네, 친구들이 저를 믿고 뽑아 주었어요.","zh":"是的，同学们信任我，选了我当班长。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"친구들이","meaning":"同学们","explanation":"친구：朋友；这里指班里的同学。-들 表示复数，-이 标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구들이","audio":"/audio/fc733398017081eca809.mp3"}},{"text":"저를","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저를","audio":"/audio/da4de346f30de5013b78.mp3"}},{"text":"믿고","meaning":"信赖，依靠","explanation":"믿다：信赖，依靠；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"믿다","audio":"/audio/03fdf42bef953df48966.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69478","senseId":"2","lemma":"믿다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"믿고","audio":"/audio/db6f26703003984ed43e.mp3"}},{"text":"뽑아","meaning":"选拔，选","explanation":"뽑다：选拔，选；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"뽑다","audio":"/audio/8fe05f49afd4379ae870.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26962","senseId":"4","lemma":"뽑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뽑아","audio":"/audio/7e6dd774246b0c4c609c.mp3"}},{"text":"주었어요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주었어요","audio":"/audio/0cf49cdd9f63fc2e2114.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0